<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GYARADOS: Gyashaa!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DRAGONITE: Gyafooha!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That red GYARADOS wasn’t actin’ right.\nLike I thought, somebody FORCED it to\fevolve... Like a stage mom.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You came ’cause of the wild stories?\rYou {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? I’m Lance. A Hustler like\nyou. But with a cape.\rI heard some rumblin’, so I came to\nlook into it...\rI saw how you scrapped, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. You\ngot REAL skill. Not as much as me.\rCould you help me investigate? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You came ’cause of the wild stories?\rYou {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? I’m Lance. A Hustler like\nyou. But with a cape.\rI heard some rumblin’, so I came to\nlook into it...\rI saw how you scrapped, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. You\ngot REAL skill. Not as much as me.\rCould you help me investigate? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: Excellent!\rLooks like the Lake of Rage’s\nMAGIKARP gettin’ forced to evolve.\rA weird radio signal comin’ outta\nMahogany is prob’ly why.\rAnd that “souvenir shop”...\rI’ll be waitin’ on you in Mahogany,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: Excellent!\rLooks like the Lake of Rage’s\nMAGIKARP gettin’ forced\fto evolve.\rA weird radio signal comin’ outta\nMahogany is why.\rI’ll be waitin’ on you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Well, if you change your mind,\nhelp me out. I’ll be dramatically\fstarin’ at the lake.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: What you think?\nYou finna help me? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The GYARADOS is MAD!\nIt’s a bad omen! The end is near!\fI’m sellin’ my house!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">HAHAH! The MAGIKARP bitin’!\nThey useless, but they bitin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They say this lake got made by\nGYARADOS wildin’ out.\rLike when my uncle get mad at the grill.\nSame energy. Big crater.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Was I trippin’? I saw a RED GYARADOS!\rAin’t GYARADOS supposed to be BLUE?!\nI need to lay off the RageCandyBars.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: The hard rain got the lake all\nriled up. Like my knees.\rWe met again for a reason.\nLet’s swap numbers. {YESNO 0}\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} saved Pryce’s number\nin the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: I train Monday mornings to give\nthis lazy old body a spine.\rYou’d be a good trainin’ partner.\nI’ll be waitin’. By the phone. Always.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: That’s OK too.\nPeople should think for themselves.\fThat’s how it is.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: So? You gon’ swap\nnumbers with me? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Scrap the big catch I just got!\nIt’s a MAGIKARP. It’s still big!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0626_T29_00020" index="20">
